Mean V/C: traffic divided by capacity (1 = at capacity).

By speed: % of traffic at most 40% of free-flow speed or in stop-and-go (roughly the purple roads).

From 07:00 nearly all traffic on other roads is at E/F, and motorways are at F in their usual jam hours: read LoS E/F together with the mean V/C.</note>
